The empty block is a member of a bracketed span's attribute run

```
[a]{}{.b}
.
<p><span class="b">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{}{}{.b}
.
<p><span class="b">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{.b}{}
.
<p><span class="b">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{ }{.b}
.
<p><span class="b">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{.b}{}{#i}
.
<p><span class="b" id="i">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{}
.
<p><span>a</span></p>
```

```
*x*{}{.b}
.
<p><strong>x</strong>{}{.b}</p>
```
